<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="c30f702e">&lt;p&gt;
    This work product documents a set of actions, with clear ownership and implementation timeline to improve performance
    to expected levels.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="5f15f6e3"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="28c5d5b7">&lt;p&gt;
    Benefits Action Plans should be developed through discussions with Benefit Sponsors and other SMRs.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The trigger for when this work product should be created will vary based on the size and scale of the program or
    project and should be documented in the benefits realization strategy. A typical trigger may be when two consecutive
    reporting periods have shown benefit performance beyond the tolerances of the forecast value.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="9e855833"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="33b8eb50">To identify appropriate steps and then track them to their completion when the realization of a particular benefit is
different from expected performance. If a benefit is not performing as expected, there may be a variety of potential
reasons: it may mean that an original assumption in the business case is incorrect, there is an unknown impact from another
program or project.</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="b5abd865"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="7949466e"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="f4bdb40a">&lt;p&gt;
    The plan is typically in a tabular format, with the following column headings:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Benefits
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Baseline performance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Expected performance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Actual performance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Target performance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Action
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Owners
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Target completion date
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Progress
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="459f93a0"></attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="e4c993cc"></attribute>
<attribute name="notation" nodeId="2cd62532"></attribute>
